  "title": "The Missing Revolution in Operations: Scaling Expertise in a Cloud-First World",
  "summary": "Operations engineering is stuck in the past. This post breaks down why ops hasn’t had the same revolution as software development, explores the limits of DevOps, and argues for scaling expertise through reusable tools and clean abstractions. It’s time for ops to adopt lessons from software engineering and move the industry forward.",
